    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "他跳起来，跑出门口，再一次往外看。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He jumped up, ran out to the doorway, and looked outside once again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "风来了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The wind had come.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "太阳几乎在沙坑笔直的顶上，烤焦的沙子上，冉冉升起模模糊糊濡湿薄膜似的雾气。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The sun was almost directly above the sand pit, and from the scorched sand a hazy, damp, filmlike mist slowly rose.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "沙壁越来越高，威严地耸立着，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The sand walls grew higher and higher, towering with a stern majesty,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "仿佛板起脸孔来教训他说，用肌肉和关节来抵抗是毫无意义的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "as if they were putting on a severe face to lecture him, telling him that resisting with muscles and joints was utterly meaningless.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "热浪刺激着他的皮肤。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The waves of heat stung his skin.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00300",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "气温骤然升高。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The temperature rose abruptly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
